"operational status</b></td><td>every <b>24 hours</b></td></"
"tr><tr><td><b>METEOR/HRPT satellites dropped from CelesTrak groups</b></"
"td><td>every <b>12 hours</b></td></tr><tr><td><b>Transmitter Database "
