#: src/ui/main_window.py:5829
msgid ""
"Transmitter data is fetched from SATNOGS automatically on first launch, then "
"refreshed automatically every 7 days in the background. Use <b>Satellite → "
"Sync SATNOGS</b> to refresh transmitter frequencies and modes manually "
"whenever you need the very latest data sooner (e.g. right after a newly "
"launched satellite registers its transmitter)."
msgstr ""

